&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8c404f6cb9a2bcfacc0714dfdbf500c7", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c7fb5284/uploads/origins/cd6fa55b-fc91-4ab0-bc35-466604743342?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8c404f6cb9a2bcfacc0714dfdbf500c7, https://si.imgix.net/c7fb5284/uploads/origins/cd6fa55b-fc91-4ab0-bc35-466604743342?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0212831fef66e704200a77550331c08c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c7fb5284/uploads/origins/cd6fa55b-fc91-4ab0-bc35-466604743342?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=13e992dd935d16e93ddb259a95a151e4 3x"}, "body": "Hello ! I really founded your artstyle so original and beautiful ! So i wanted to request a commission from you !! ( in that style ) \nhttps://skeb.jp/@hutaka72/works/5\nAnd kinda looking like this !\n\nI would like you to draw my oc’s trauma phase \nSo I’ll briefly explain it here their backstory !! \n- so Mika has albinism ( which means all his hair are white since he was born ) but his mother dyed it in black for most of his life because it’s “unnatural” \n- his mother was a single mother also gave birth to him right after his father ran away and never returned home \n- after he was born she who was heartbroken started seeing mika as a girl ( since mika was already a feminine boy ) so she started buying him girl clothing ( skirts, dresses cte…) and taught him to talk and act like a girl since he was born, which he didn’t hate when he was a young boy..he was happy to see his mother happy and wasn’t aware of differences between boys and girls ( and adults around them founded it really cute, he was also really mistaken as a girl most of his life ) but arriving middle school and starting to grow up, his body also started to look more like one of a man which made his mother go a bit insane parenting and controlling him even more, they had an argument and mika agreed to keep his hair long but he would no longer dress as a girl ( because he didn’t have that cuteness he used to have and because he started to understand from people’s view and his big brother’s that, a man who wears girls clothing was “weird” ) since that mika has always hated to be called “cute” or “pretty” because it reminds him of his past traumas and of his male inferiority ( never feeling like being a real man ) ( there’s actually more going on later but i wanna keep it simple and straightforward for the drawing ! )\n\nSo in this piece i would like you to draw him with black hair and slightly white hair ( bc the dye is slowly disappearing ) with long hair !! ( i would say till the waist ) and keep his eyelashes completely white ! For the clothes please make him have a Gakuren ! \nHe mesures ( as a middle schooler ) 1.64 m \n\nFor the pose u can draw him with any you found good and fitting i completely trust your judgment on it !! \n \nI’ll have some references in the attached file ! ( i’m sorry if i’m a bit precise about my commission feel free to draw some things differently !! )\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1OBdIMIC7PZmgY7ZLLn8CBBES2BHrddiZ", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hutaka72/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1591784, "client_id": 3973883, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c48d7103/uploads/origins/c9803295-ff3f-4a59-8068-822930580b06?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1ac9d4584a35c1284f84648b57e509fc", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c48d7103/uploads/origins/c9803295-ff3f-4a59-8068-822930580b06?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1ac9d4584a35c1284f84648b57e509fc, https://si.imgix.net/c48d7103/uploads/origins/c9803295-ff3f-4a59-8068-822930580b06?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&f